[00:12.450]I'm waiting in my cold cell
[00:17.880]when the bell begins to chime
[00:24.320]Reflecting on my past life
[00:29.990]and it doesn't have much time
[00:36.050]'Cuase at 5 o'clock they take me
[00:40.540]to the Gallows Pole
[00:48.900]The sands of time for me are running low
[01:08.640]Running low……Yeah！
[01:18.720][01:37.410]When the priest comes to read me the last rites
[01:39.770]I take a look through the bars at the last sights
[01:42.120]Of a world that has gone very wrong for me
[01:46.880]Can it be there's been some sort of an error
[01:48.950]Hard to stop the surmounting terror
[01:51.760]Is it really the end not some crazy dream
[01:55.330][01:56.610]Somebody please tell me that I'm dreaming
[01:59.140]It's not easy to stop from screaming
[02:00.790]But words escape me when I try to speak
[02:05.740]Tears they flow but why am I crying?
[02:07.830]After all am I not afraid of dying
[02:10.180]Don't believe that there never is an end
[03:10.670]As the guards march me out to the courtyard
[03:12.680]Someone calls from a cell "God be with you"
[03:15.090]If there's a God then why has he let me die?
[03:19.870]As I walk all my life drifts before me
[03:21.840]And though the end is near I'm not sorry
[03:24.140]Catch my soul 'cause it's willing to fly away
[03:27.900][03:28.710]Mark my words believe my soul lives on
[03:31.560]Don't worry now that I have gone
[03:33.770]I've gone beyond to see the truth
[03:38.390]When you know that your time is close at hand
[03:40.370]Maybe then you'll begin to understand
[03:43.060]Life down there is just a strange illusion
[06:25.520]Yeah, yeah, yeah,
[06:29.940]Hallowed be Thy name
[06:34.350]Yeah, yeah, yeah,
[06:38.720]Hallowed be Thy name
[06:56.200]Yeah～～～！！！
